          "description": "Juna the Unicorn is full of sparkle, wonder, and heart. In each magical story, she explores enchanted forests, helps fairy friends, and discovers her own bravery, even when things don’t go quite as planned. With a horn that twinkles when she feels deeply, Juna learns that kindness and trying again are what true magic is made of. Perfect for ages 2–5, these gentle, imaginative stories are just right for bedtime or quiet, cozy moments.",
